--- SMD_TS2_TS3 ---

Steered MD stage generating the starting configurations for the TS2 <-> TS3 umbrella-sampling
scan (see ../USW_100_TS2_TS3/README and ../README). This is the only leg of the reaction
network pulled along two coordinates simultaneously: MOVINGRESTRAINT drives 'cobh' (2.8->1.8)
and 'cowh' (1.9->0.9) together over 100000 steps, KAPPA=200 kcal/mol/A^2 each — i.e. the
leaving-group and nucleophile coordination spheres reorganize concurrently between TS2 and
TS3, unlike the TS1-TS2 and TS1-TS3 legs which each isolate one of the two. Same background
wall restraints as the other pph4 pipelines apply (see PMF_react_TS1/SMD_react_TS1/README).
Restart snapshots are converted into 'lmp_files/' seed structures the same way.

Three replicas (rep1/2/3) — one README covers all three.

Note: this README documents pre-existing content; no existing file was modified.
